WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:59.060
<b>Straw Hat Luffy</b>

3
00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:57.680
[YAMATO]
Ooh, that was good!

4
00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:01.730
[YAMATO laughs]
You pirates know
some funny tricks!

5
00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.600
<b>Several Years Ago</b>

6
00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:04.020
Teach me how to do that one, too!

7
00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:07.690
<b>Onigashima
During Kaido's Absence</b>

8
00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:06.060
[KAIDO]
Huh?

9
00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:09.900
<b>Several Years Ago</b>

10
00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:09.280
[YAMATO]
Huh? Um... Hello?

11
00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:09.900
<b>Onigashima
During Kaido's Absence</b>

12
00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:11.360
[gasps]

13
00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:14.150
[YAMATO]
Oh no! No, no, no, no, no! Ace!

14
00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:16.950
What happened to you?

15
00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:20.080
I thought we were having fun,
but now you're out cold?

16
00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.210
[gasps]
It can't be.

17
00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:28.210
[FRANKY, USOPP]
– Come on, man!
– Come on, man!

18
00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:32.970
Uh... I fell asleep.

19
00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:36.010
Don't freak me out like that, I thought
you were dead! My bad.

20
00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:39.670
Yeah. I do that sometimes.

21
00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:41.890
I was really worried about you!

22
00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:46.020
Well, whatever, If you're tired,
we should call it a night.

23
00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:48.270
I mean, you look like you wanna go.

24
00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:50.070
[ACE]
What're you talking about, Yamato?

25
00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:52.650
Nobody is calling it a night just yet!

26
00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:57.280
I gotta meet up with my crew first thing
in the morning and it's already getting late.

27
00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:59.870
It'd be a waste to go to sleep, dontcha think?

28
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.160
Okay, but you better not fall asleep!

29
00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.040
I'll give it my best.

30
00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.290
Now let me think, where were we?

31
00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:12.050
You were talking about your brother again, obviously!

32
00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:17.430
Ahh, that's right, you were talking about how
you want to become Kozuki Oden!

33
00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.350
Close, but not quite, Ace.

34
00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:22.100
I don't want to be him. I will be!

35
00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.810
I'll make my dream come true.

36
00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:26.560
It's all right here.

37
00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:33.070
"Oden's Travel Record"

38
00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:28.400
My map to the future!

39
00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:31.820
[MOMONOSUKE]
D?

40
00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:34.320
Oh?

41
00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:39.570
Funny. I never thought we'd meet,
but all of a sudden you were here!

42
00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:42.290
That says "Oden."

43
00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.910
[gasps]
That journal, was it my father's?

44
00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:51.500
[YAMATO]
It sure was. A tale of his adventures
across the world, of a life well-lived.

45
00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:56.300
[YAMATO]
I found the journal on the shore
of the river below Oden Castle.

46
00:03:57.050 --> 00:04:00.640
Someone must have protected it
from burning inside.

47
00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.260
[SHINOBU]
A miracle.

48
00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:05.220
[YAMATO]
Momonosuke.

49
00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:10.190
You should know. Oden wrote
a lot about you in this book.

50
00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:12.230
[gasps]

51
00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:15.110
It says in here that
you were born on Whitebeard's ship!

52
00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.930
After that, you saw Roger's, too!

53
00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:26.700
[MOMONOSUKE]
But I was so young, I hardly rember
a thing from then. It pains me to say that now.

54
00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:29.960
[YAMATO]
Whitebeard, Roger, and Oden.

55
00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:31.290
They all made the same claim.

56
00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.500
About twenty years after their trip,

57
00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:39.260
here in the New World, strong young pirates
would show up in droves.

58
00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:41.380
And here we are today.

59
00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:49.140
[YAMATO]
I was sure that Ace
would be at the top of that list.

60
00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:54.270
[YAMATO]
But when he died,
I suddenly recalled something.

61
00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:56.570
Something he told me that night.

62
00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:00.200
[YAMATO]
What?

63
00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.160
[yells]
Aw crap.

64
00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:05.740
It just slipped out!

65
00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.450
Oh, I wasn't gonna tell you that.

66
00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:10.710
Just forget I said anything!

67
00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:12.710
Oh, and you better not laugh!

68
00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:14.790
Sabo and I won't stand for it!

69
00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.510
[YAMATO]
You know.
I have never left this country.

70
00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:23.800
So even the things I know,
I probably haven't seen with my own eyes.

71
00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:28.930
I hadn't seen the world Oden wrote about,
or the family Ace told me about.

72
00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:33.150
But there was something
in that moment we shared

73
00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:35.110
that was real to me.

74
00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.820
That's my brother's dream.

75
00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.820
Even to this day.

76
00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.580
[SABO]
We're gonna leave
this country someday.

77
00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:50.580
Set out to sea and live free.

78
00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:55.880
And after I've traveled the world, I'm gonna write
a book about all of my adventures. And I won't

79
00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:58.880
even mind doing it, because I love sailing!

80
00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:03.090
So let's become stronger,
because we're gonna be pirates!

81
00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:07.510
– Hm? Exactly. I've been planning
to be a pirate from the start!

82
00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:14.060
I'll be so tough that all the other pirates and even the Marines
will bow at my feet! The whole world will know my name!

83
00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:17.270
That'll be the legacy I leave behind!

84
00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:23.150
[ACE]
People can hate me, or they can wish
that I'd never been born, but they're not gonna ignore me!

85
00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:27.580
That's what it means to be strong!
To be a great pirate!

86
00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:31.500
[GOLD ROGER]
Seems odd the Government
prohibits us from looking into it, huh?

87
00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.370
There must be a vast treasure there!

88
00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:38.790
It makes it all the more tantalizing to me!

89
00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:42.800
If we find it, the world
would know without a doubt

90
00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.760
that we're the greatest pirate crew of all!

91
00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:47.510
Ah, yes, I see.

92
00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.220
[LUFFY laughs]
Oh, I got it.

93
00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:53.390
Alright then!

94
00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.060
[GOLD ROGER]
Okay!

95
00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.730
Ready?

96
00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:02.530
I'm gonna be–

97
00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:09.660
[ACE chuckles]
You dork,
always trying to show me up.

98
00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:11.660
[WHITEBEARD]
You sound like a child, Roger!

99
00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.920
[SABO laughs]
Well, I dunno
if you're gonna be a king or not,

100
00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:19.040
but you're gonna do something crazy,
I'll say that much!

101
00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:32.100
When I heard Luffy say that, well...
Sabo and I laughed right at his face.

102
00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:35.480
Even so. I won't let anyone else laugh.

103
00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:37.100
'Cause I believe in Luffy.

104
00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:40.860
Ace! I don't doubt for a second
that he'll be able to pull it off. That's why–

105
00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:44.490
What's up?

106
00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.490
Hey.

107
00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:49.010
Yamato, are you crying?

108
00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:53.700
I promise, I won't laugh at him!

109
00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:58.290
Those are the exact words
the King of the Pirates said!

110
00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:01.090
The words that moved Oden's heart.

111
00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:07.300
Oden spoke of a great man he met,
and that man said the exact same words as your brother!

112
00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:08.930
It sounds like Luffy is

113
00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:10.930
every bit as amazing as you claim!

114
00:08:12.810 --> 00:08:14.430
Ohh. A great man, you say?

115
00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:15.930
I wonder what he's like.

116
00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:19.400
I hope someday Luffy
and I can talk with him over a drink.

117
00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:22.610
[YAMATO laughs]
I'm sure
you would've gotten along!

118
00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:24.570
A pity he's already dead.

119
00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.370
Wait, he's dead?

120
00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.490
[laughs]
I guess in that case,
we'll pour one out.

121
00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:32.490
Hey.

122
00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.490
What is it this time?

123
00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:36.370
Do you think

124
00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.460
we could share drinks instead?

125
00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:42.290
Not like now. I mean,
like me, you, and your brother!

126
00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:45.050
Somewhere at sea
after I can get away from here.

127
00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:46.670
That sounds like a blast!

128
00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.670
Y'really mean it?

129
00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.680
But, one thing, the sea's not exactly small.

130
00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:54.430
If you take too long to leave here,
I might be so far away that I'll never

131
00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:55.430
get to see– Oh, don't worry!

132
00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:57.680
I just need something.

133
00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.480
A fingernail clipping or a hair!

134
00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:00.770
[ACE]
Huh?

135
00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:03.270
[YAMATO]
Your choice! Whatever you want!

136
00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:04.270
[ACE]
Oh, okay!

137
00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.570
Wait...

138
00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:12.570
[YAMATO]
I made this!

139
00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:13.240
[ACE]
Huh?

140
00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:15.200
[YAMATO]
It's your Vivre Card!

141
00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.950
[ACE]
Ohh. So this is it, huh?

142
00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:21.290
This is just a piece of paper!

143
00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:27.090
Yeah, and it's really special!
Because this paper will bring us back together someday.

144
00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:28.420
[ACE]
How does that work?

145
00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:29.970
[YAMATO]
Watch.

146
00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:40.060
If there's someone you want to see again, just tear off a piece
and give it them so they can find you.

147
00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:41.600
Great.

148
00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.480
Thanks a bunch!

149
00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:00.660
[ACE]
Yamato!

150
00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.360
[gasps]

151
00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:05.880
You better not lose that!

152
00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:24.940
[USOPP]
Hey!

153
00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:34.110
Huh? What's this about?

154
00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.580
[YAMATO]
Goodbye, Ace!

155
00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.540
Promise you'll come back!

156
00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.170
[ACE]
You bet I will!

157
00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:04.020
[YAMATO]
That... was the last time I saw him.

158
00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:15.860
[KAIDO]
My fool of a son is at it again, I see.

159
00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:20.700
That's fine. Thanks to Red Hair's interruption,
I have a bit of time to kill.

160
00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:24.250
I can deal with one little temper tantrum, after all.

161
00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:31.920
You promised that
you would come back someday.

162
00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:39.850
[KAIDO]
He can cling
to whatever nonsense he likes.

163
00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:59.030
[KAIDO]
He'll never get off this island.

164
00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.740
I'll make sure of that.

165
00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:03.500
[screams]

166
00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:05.900
[YAMATO grunts]

167
00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:09.210
[YAMATO]
My father is too strong!

168
00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:12.670
I'm gonna die in this damned place!

169
00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:17.550
[sobs]
I had one friend
in this world and he died.

170
00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:21.260
I couldn't save him.

171
00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:23.430
I couldn't do anything.

172
00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:28.250
I'll never be free.

173
00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.310
[ACE]
Why are you letting
him chain your heart?

174
00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.480
[YAMATO]
I'm trying, Ace.

175
00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.780
I want to be free like Oden,

176
00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:40.070
but I can't.

177
00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:45.790
[ODEN]
"Now, I can't help
but look to the future. In twenty years,

178
00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:52.000
strong young pirates will come
to the New World in droves and lead us to a new era."

179
00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:56.510
The toughest one is gonna show up
a few years from now, and that's my brother!

180
00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:59.950
You'll see! He's gonna make a big wave!

181
00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:01.380
[gasps]

182
00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:06.260
It's time to come home.

183
00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:09.230
[YAMATO]
Then I'll be patient.

184
00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:12.560
I'll wait for the same thing
Oden was holding out for.

185
00:13:13.190 --> 00:13:15.650
We don't want to fight. Please come back.

186
00:13:16.030 --> 00:13:18.780
[YAMATO]
I know the next era will come.

187
00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:20.070
I have faith.

188
00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:22.780
You hear that?

189
00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:24.740
I'm waiting for you, Luffy.

190
00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.750
I'll keep fighting until then.

191
00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:31.170
If you don't start listening to me and soon,

192
00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:35.500
I'll beat the truth into you
until you understand.

193
00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:39.540
If that's what you want, fine.
I can beat you right back.

194
00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:48.970
[ACE]
That's it, Yamato!

195
00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:53.770
Hey, you old bastard, I am Kozuki Oden!

196
00:13:56.900 --> 00:14:02.280
[YAMATO]
On the day that Ace died, I still had no idea
what was happening in the outside world.

197
00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:05.740
But later, I read all about it in a newspaper.

198
00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:10.870
I learned that Ace was the son
of Gol D. Roger, the King of the Pirates.

199
00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:16.340
And just like he said he would, his brother
also made a name for himself as a pirate.

200
00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:19.300
And now Luffy's here, thanks to you!

201
00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.550
[YAMATO]
Momonosuke.

202
00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:27.390
[YAMATO]
Here, this belongs to you.

203
00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:32.350
This is what Oden wrote about the future.

204
00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:38.980
[YAMATO]
"Now, I can't help
but look to the future."

205
00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:46.320
[YAMATO]
"In twenty years,
strong young pirates will come to the New World in

206
00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:49.970
droves and lead us to a new era."

207
00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.290
[YAMATO]
"Do not fear if I die."

208
00:14:56.580 --> 00:15:01.330
[YAMATO]
"For they shall appear
in my stead, and defeat Kaido!"

209
00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.090
[KAIDO]
You want the One Piece?

210
00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:14.480
[KAIDO]
You think you can tread upon the same path
as beasts such as I? That's a dream within a dream.

211
00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:22.940
I'm sure you've had fun playing pirates.
But this isn't some game.

212
00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:26.910
Your lesson isn't reaching
these children, Kaido.

213
00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:28.320
Let me give it a try.

214
00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.740
[KILLER chuckles]

215
00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:36.670
[KID chuckles]
Yeah. I feel it.

216
00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:39.380
We'll have our moment, Killer.

217
00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.880
[KID]
I've even gathered up an arsenal!

218
00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:49.760
I'm gonna bury you, you damn Emperors!

219
00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:03.380
[ZORO]
I had it under cont–

220
00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:05.650
[KID]
Huh? Another one?

221
00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.610
[KILLER]
That was sloppy. Are all you

222
00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.740
Straw Hats so fast and loose with your plans?

223
00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:12.620
[ZORO]
I assure you, this was not my plan.

224
00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:15.700
No, their captain is the fast and loose one.

225
00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.210
Where is he, by the way?

226
00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.210
The Worst Generation.

227
00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.590
They just keep slinking in.

228
00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:30.640
Let them pile up, they'll scatter
like dust in the wind.

229
00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:38.140
[KAIDO]
Even if you strike
at this old wound, I won't feel it.

230
00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:45.940
Sit your asses down
and give up, you damn rookies.

231
00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:48.950
Like the Akazaya samurai did.

232
00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:03.040
[ODEN]
Now, I can't help
but look to the future.

233
00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:14.220
[ODEN]
In twenty years, strong young pirates will come
to the New World in droves and lead us to a new era.

234
00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:18.430
[ODEN]
Do not fear if I die.

235
00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:25.110
[ODEN]
For they shall appear in my stead,

236
00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:28.740
and defeat Kaido!

237
00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:31.360
We don't need backup to win.

238
00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.620
Why don't you sit down
and watch how it's done.

239
00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:34.830
I refuse.

240
00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:34.830
What he said.

241
00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:37.790
I'm gonna eat you boys alive.

242
00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:42.500
[KAIDO]
Straw Hat.

243
00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:43.550
Huh?

244
00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:00.680
Hey, Linlin.

245
00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:04.440
Do you know what this little punk said
to me the last time I ran into him?

246
00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:06.940
I can imagine. He's pretty cheeky!

247
00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:10.940
And he's got quite a mouth on him!
But that wasn't the worst of it!

248
00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:14.570
He ruined my party and destroyed my castle!

249
00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:18.080
So how about an apology?
Eh, Straw Hat? Huh?

250
00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:24.500
You got nothing to say?

251
00:18:24.960 --> 00:18:28.800
C'mon, kid, where's that bravado of yours?

252
00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:33.590
Tell us what you're gonna be.
I dare you. Say it to our faces!

253
00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:42.060
[KIN'EMON]
Remember,
we're counting on you.

254
00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:45.850
[KIN'EMON]
Sir Luffy!

255
00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:52.320
I am so grateful.

256
00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:04.330
[LUFFY]
Kin'emon, are you all right?

257
00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:07.750
[LUFFY]
I tried to hurry.

258
00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.340
Sorry I took so long.

259
00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.220
[KIN'EMON]
I am full of regret.

260
00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:26.020
I can't even die.

261
00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:27.810
I'm too ashamed.

262
00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:33.560
How can I show my face
to Lord Oden in the afterlife?

263
00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:34.740
Kin, no!

264
00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.950
[KIN'EMON]
Can you carry the weight for me?

265
00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:43.750
Will you deliver this country?

266
00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:46.620
I...

267
00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:47.750
[LUFFY]
Don't be stupid!

268
00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:49.290
Of course I will!

269
00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:52.590
Because you are my friend!

270
00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:01.430
[KAIDO]
You ignoring me?

271
00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:05.390
[KIN'EMON]
Sir Luffy.

272
00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:06.690
[SANJI]
I...

273
00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.940
[MOMONOSUKE]
I thank you.

274
00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:13.570
Traffy!

275
00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:15.990
Traffy! Move them all downstairs!

276
00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:23.700
Not again! What is happening?

277
00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:25.700
[MOMONOSUKE]
Luffy.

278
00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:34.630
[HYOGORO]
You call it Haki, but in the Land
of Wano, it's known as "Ryuo."

279
00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:37.510
The term means "flow."

280
00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:40.720
[KIN'EMON]
Lord Oden was executed.

281
00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:45.060
By order of the Shogun of Wano
who is in an alliance with the pirate, Kaido.

282
00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:47.680
[DOGSTORM]
Sir Raizo is here, and he is well.

283
00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:49.980
[CAT VIPER]
Our people
would never sell out a friend.

284
00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:50.190
[CAT VIPER]
Our people
would never sell out a friend. [PEDRO]
Listen! You-gara
must keep moving forward!

285
00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:53.110
[PEDRO]
Listen! You-gara
must keep moving forward!

286
00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:57.440
[YASUIE]
The happy-go-lucky fool
from Ebisu Town makes his final journey!

287
00:20:57.440 --> 00:21:00.660
[HYOGORO]
The rebellion's flame
still burns bright.

288
00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:02.700
[KIN'EMON]
To Onigashima!

289
00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.900
Our moment is now!

290
00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:10.420
[LUFFY]
But when Kaido
killed him twenty years ago,

291
00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:12.830
everything in this country came
to a complete standstill.

292
00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:15.960
Nobody deserves to be laughed
at when they die. Big deal!

293
00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:19.260
Why's it so wrong to get help from me, huh?

294
00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:21.760
Speak up for yourself! You're in charge, right?

295
00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:25.140
Aren't you the leader of these guys?
Say something already!

296
00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:31.370
[MOMONOSUKE]
I want
to vanquish Emperor Kaido!

297
00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:38.320
Now come with me!

298
00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:11.270
Hey! Kaido! What are you doing?

299
00:22:11.270 --> 00:22:14.690
I can't believe you let him knock you down!

300
00:22:15.620 --> 00:22:17.290
[BIG MOM gasps]

301
00:22:17.400 --> 00:22:20.360
[LUFFY]
I am Monkey D. Luffy.

302
00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:23.280
The man who will surpass you.

303
00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:29.200
And I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!
